Table full name: MITELMAN.PROD.REFERENCE
Column name: Journal Type: TEXT Description: journal name abbreviation, eg 'Cancer Genet Cytogenet'
Column name: AuthorsLength Type: TEXT Description: author string length, up to 2411
Column name: Flag Type: TEXT Description: this field is always blank
Column name: Abbreviation Type: TEXT Description: author abbreviation, eg 'Park et al 2009'
Column name: Year Type: NUMBER Description: publication year, eg '1998'
Column name: Pubmed Type: TEXT Description: PubMed identifier, if available, eg '17334343'
Column name: TitleLength Type: NUMBER Description: length of title, up to 334
Column name: AuthorsLong Type: TEXT Description: blank or complete, long author string
Column name: Text Type: TEXT Description: this field is always blank
Column name: AuthorsShort Type: TEXT Description: short or truncated author string, eg 'Atkin NB, Baker MC'
Column name: TitleLong Type: TEXT Description: blank for shorter titles, otherwise the full title is in this field
Column name: RefNo Type: NUMBER Description: reference number from 10 to 15880
Column name: Volume Type: TEXT Description: journal volume, eg '95:96-101'
Column name: TitleShort Type: TEXT Description: short or truncated title, eg aThe myeloperoxidase gene in acute promyelocytic leukemia'
